###
# MediFlow pharmacy-service live API collection
#
# IntelliJ users can set `token` globally from auth.http. VS Code users may uncomment
# the next line and use a local development token. Never commit a real token.
# @token = replace-with-local-development-token
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Search drugs
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/drugs?keyword=para&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-drug-search-demo

### Get drug detail
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/drugs/50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-drug-detail-demo

### Create drug
POST {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-drug-create-demo

{
  "drugName": "Paracetamol 500mg",
  "activeIngredient": "Paracetamol",
  "unit": "viên",
  "price": 1200.00,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "expiryDate": "2027-09-15",
  "manufacturer": "MediFlow Pharma",
  "lowStockThreshold": 20
}

### Adjust stock
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/drugs/50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-stock-adjust-demo

{
  "quantity": 25,
  "reason": "Nhập kho định kỳ"
}

### Create prescription
POST {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: pharmacy-create-demo

{
  "recordId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "patientId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "doctorId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "departmentId": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "prescribedDate": "2026-09-04",
  "lines": [
    {
      "drugId": "50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "quantity": 2,
      "dosage": "Uống 1 viên sau ăn sáng và tối"
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel prescription and release reserved stock
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions/60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: pharmacy-cancel-demo

{
  "reason": "Bác sĩ thay đổi phác đồ điều trị"
}

### Get prescription detail
GET {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions/60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-prescription-detail-demo

### Dispense a paid prescription
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions/60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/dispense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-dispense-demo

### Replay a quarantined outbox event — ADMIN only
POST {{host}}/api/v1/pharmacy/admin/outbox/70000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: pharmacy-outbox-replay-demo
